OL,3,GNEWSACampaign to save former cinema
OL,4,Atakes step forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign to bring a former cinema
OL,7,Fback into use has taken a step forward
OL,8,Fafter it was officially listed as an
OL,9,FAsset of Community Value (ACV).
OL,11,FThe New Ritz Collective - which seeks
OL,12,Fto revive The Ritz in Ilkeston,
OL,13,FDerbyshire - has said the decision is
OL,14,F"a significant milestone in efforts to
OL,15,Fbring the landmark building back into
OL,16,Fmeaningful community use".
OL,18,FThe listed former cinema and bingo hall
OL,19,Fsits on the corner of South Street and
OL,20,FCoronation Street and has stood empty
OL,21,Ffor eight years.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
